      "id": "measuring-distances"
    },
    "summary": "2 models whose bases touch are in base contact (or base-to-base contact), which puts them as close as possible to each other.\n\nIf an enemy model’s overhang stops your moving model from touching its base, the 2 count as in base contact until the turn ends while all of these hold:\n\n- your model’s move could have reached base contact without the overhang\n- neither can get any nearer the other\n- some part of one is within 1\" of some part of the other",
